# Steel Hellkite: "{X}: Destroy each nonland permanent with mana value X whose controller was dealt combat damage by this
# creature this turn. Activate only once each turn." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Black Lotus and three Moxen) and Grizzly Bears
# on turn 3. Bot2 has Grizzly Bears (mana value 2), Memnite and two Moxen (mana value 0) and an Island. The flying Hellkite
# is unblocked and hits Bot2 (15). X=2 then destroys Bot2's Grizzly Bears only: Memnite, the Moxen (mana value 0) and the
# Island survive, and so does Bot1's own Grizzly Bears (mana value 2), whose controller was not dealt damage. A second
# activation (X=0) is refused: only once each turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Steel Hellkite
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
